@startuml
!include style.puml
title SD04a — F07 isolated simulation; GUI preview reuses interpreted fields
boundary "ScenarioPanel / EventPlanningCLI" as V
control EventPlanningController as C
control EventPlanningFacade as F
participant AdaptivePlanningService as S
participant EventPlanningAgent as A
entity "original: Event" as E
entity "copy: Event" as Copy
V -> C : simulateScenario(eventId, request)
C -> F : simulateScenario(eventId, request)
F -> S : simulate(event, request)
S -> S : interpret(event, request)
S -> A : milestoneOutput(interpret instruction, context)
ref over A : SD08 JSON-object generation; adaptive service checks feature fields
A --> S : changes / ambiguities
note over S : Reject unsupported/ambiguous changes; checked() validates a snapshot
S -> E : snapshot()
E --> S : copy
S -> Copy : applyChanges(change.changes())
S -> A : milestoneOutput(analysis instruction, before/after context)
A --> S : impacts / warnings / recommendations
note over S,Copy
  Java checks copied tasks/schedule/budget and calculates deltas.
  Snapshot has no original observers/communications.
  Expense delta is a rough attendance-proportional estimate.
end note
S --> F : ScenarioResult(change, copy, deltas, ...)
note over F : mutate captures equal before/after; repository.save is not called
F --> C : transient ScenarioResult
C --> V : display simulation; original unchanged
== Separate GUI real-change preview ==
boundary PlanUpdatesPanel as PV
participant PartBWorkflow as W
PV -> W : previewChange(id, request)
W -> C : simulateScenario(id, request)
ref over C,F : Same simulation path above
C --> W : ScenarioResult
W -> C : proposeChangeFields(id, result.proposedChanges().changes())
ref over C,S : SD04b stores pending proposal, not applied event facts
W --> PV : analyzed ScenarioResult
note over W,S : Exact analyzed fields are proposed; request is not interpreted twice
@enduml
